{"type": "vertex_text", "round": 19, "text": "I have performed the requested automatic filing repair and comprehensive review. The audit confirmed that the draft is complete, internally consistent, and that all claims are fully supported by the detailed description and the original disclosure. The reference numerals are used consistently across the description and figure specifications.\n\nAs part of the final review and polish, I made minor, non-substantive edits to the abstract and the detailed description to improve clarity and formality. The core technical and legal disclosures remain unchanged.\n\nThe draft has been verified against all known filing gates and is ready for publication. The task is now complete."}
