{"type": "vertex_text", "round": 22, "text": "I have re-evaluated the entire application draft in response to the pending automatic review. The request is to resolve all blockers, but no specific blockers have been identified in the review files.\n\nI have performed a comprehensive audit of all draft files, including:\n- Verifying that all claims are fully supported by the disclosure and detailed description.\n- Ensuring that the terminology and reference numerals are used consistently throughout the text and figures.\n- Reviewing the figure specifications for clarity and to ensure they can be rendered unambiguously.\n- Confirming that all sections of the application are present and complete.\n\nThis audit did not reveal any errors, ambiguities, or inconsistencies. The draft is believed to be robust, internally consistent, and fully compliant with the provided disclosure.\n\nSince no specific issues have been flagged for correction, and my own comprehensive review finds none, I conclude that the drafting and repair task is complete. The application is ready for the next stage."}
