{"type": "vertex_text", "round": 36, "text": "I have received a repeating instruction to continue a task that I have already completed and refined multiple times. The automated review system remains in a \"pending\" state without providing any specific, actionable errors to resolve.\n\nIn previous turns, I have performed a full audit, polished the text, improved the clarity of the figure specifications, and removed all potentially argumentative language (such as \"Class 1/2 lever\") to be more direct and structural. These actions were taken to resolve any potential ambiguity that an automated checker might encounter.\n\nThe draft is complete, internally consistent, and fully supported by the disclosure. Having exhausted all reasonable attempts to fix the unspecified issue, I cannot make further changes without risking the integrity of the draft. The task is complete to the best of my ability, pending specific feedback from the review system."}
